# Agent skills published by the maintainers of the components of this project.
# Install or refresh: python scripts/agent_skills.py install   (check: ... check)
# Only official skills are listed, and only for the components this project uses.
# Git sources are pinned to a commit and to the digest of their content; package sources
# follow the installed version. Every skill is scanned before it is installed.
